                                  "id": "m8pfH",
                                  "name": "Desc",
                                  "fill": "$muted",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "Every target distance comes from one law. A pair with no loop sits at a distance that grows with its genomic separation, with the exponent measured from the cell type's own Hi-C. A loop pulls its two anchors closer the more reads support it, up to touching.",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                                  "fontFamily": "$font",
